# Global ripgrep config — loaded via RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH (set in ~/.claude/settings.json env).
# Purpose: keep secrets out of broad/recursive searches so `rg` / `grep` never
# incidentally surfaces env or key material into the agent's context.
# Backstops the Read(**/.env*) deny rule, which only guards the Read tool + explicit greps.

--glob=!.env
--glob=!.env.*
--glob=!.env*
--glob=!.envrc
--glob=!*.envrc
--glob=!secrets
--glob=!secrets.*
--glob=!*.pem
--glob=!*.key
--glob=!id_rsa
--glob=!id_ed25519
